# Build-context hygiene — keep the image lean and avoid sending gitignored
# artifacts (data/, models/) to the Docker daemon. They are bind-mounted at
# runtime (see docker-compose.yml), never COPY'd into the image.
.git
.gitignore
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
data/
models/
tests/
notebooks/
reports/
docs/
README.md